Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, python3
Description: native engine for the FTL dungeon-crawler games
 Firestaff is a C11 and SDL engine for Dungeon Master, Chaos Strikes Back,
 Dungeon Master II: Skullkeep, Dungeon Master Nexus, and Theron's Quest.
 .
 This package does not contain original game data. Players must provide their
 own legally obtained game files.
